{"id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md","title":"与全部一致固定点相容的固定点类","display":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 与全部一致固定点相容的固定点类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","91-df-intrinsic-fp","91-df-self-supporting"],"display":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 与全部一致固定点相容的固定点类","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-intrinsic-fp</span><span>91-df-self-supporting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 与全部一致固定点相容的固定点类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a> 的签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X,\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X,\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\)</span> 是相容性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_J\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_J\\)</span> 为下述固定点子类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X\\cup Y),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Int}_J\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J):\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X\\cup Y),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Int}_J\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J):\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 各自一致时，这等价于没有一句在一个集合为真、在另一个为假。量化仅遍历句子编码，非法编码默认值不参与否定冲突。\n极小固定点属于此类，因为它包含于每个一致固定点。“从极小固定点继续迭代”不会取得新信息，故不能用那种生成方式定义 intrinsic。\n此术语是目录对 Kripke 相容性思想的辅助分类；所给 Halbach 书没有在这里列出名为 intrinsic fixed point 的正式定义。不声称整个子类有唯一成员，也不把哲学上的“自然选择”当作数学结论。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1 的一致固定点和极小性；相容性/内在分类为本目录明确的辅助约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_T$、$J$、$\\operatorname{ConInfo}$ 使用 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的签名；$\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X,\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_T","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X,\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X\\cup Y),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Int}_J\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J):\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;\\operatorname{Comp}(X,Y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false}],"bytes":1742,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a2d46f83be2796a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J),\\mathrm{Int}_J,\\operatorname{Comp}$ 见 [[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]]；$\\mathrm{Ext}_J$ 是下述补类。"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axiom